t":"ential files under `config/`; changes apply to subsequent requests without restarting the container."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"## DSH updates"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"Every `docker compose up` rebuilds the `dsh` service and installs `@deepseek-ai/dsh@latest`. The bui"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"ld requires npm registry access and may take longer than reusing an existing image. The image applie"},{"id":"p14s3","text":"s a guarded compatibility patch to the browser client so the authenticated reverse proxy can expose "},{"id":"p14s4","text":"the settings document. The patch fails the build when the upstream client shape changes and requires"},{"id":"p14s5","text":" a deliberate compatibility review."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"## Public deployment"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"Public deployment requires a DNS record, a TLS certificate, Nginx, and a reverse proxy. Do not expos"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"e the Docker port directly to the Internet."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"Set the public authority and the URL that should be printed for the first browser visit in `.env`:"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"Start DSH and keep its port bound to localhost:"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"Copy the `dsh web:` URL from the logs and open it through the public HTTPS address. DSH exchanges it"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"s one-time token for an authority-bound, signed browser-session cookie. No separate login service or"},{"id":"p21s3","text":" `htpasswd` file is required."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"Use `nginx/dsh.conf.example` as the reverse-proxy starting point, then set its `server_name`, TLS ce"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"rtificate paths, and HTTPS listener. Render the backend port from `.env`:"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"The proxy must preserve the public authority for both `Host` and `Origin`. DSH rejects mismatched or"},{"id":"p24s2","text":" untrusted authorities with `403`; a trusted request without the official browser cookie returns `40"},{"id":"p24s3","text":"trusted authorities with `403`; a trusted request without the official browser cookie returns `401`."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"The public URL is then `https://dsh.example.com`."}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
